  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ending Agricultural Bonded Labour in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&#x2019;s expected effect(s) on society is reduction in the prevalence of agricultural bonded labour in Nepal (Impact).

The expected effects for the target groups of the Project are threefold (Outcomes): 

Outcome 1: A united movement of agricultural bonded labour groups is formed and active at the national level.

Outcome 2: The government changes policies to address agricultural bonded labour and provide support services for survivors.

Outcome 3: Agricultural bonded labourers have greater resilience as a result of accessing government and NGO support services.

The intended target groups are agricultural bonded labourers and survivors from marginalised ethnic groups in Nepal.</narrative>
  </description>
